  "content": "\n\n<h1>更好的配方書</h1>\n<p>為原版配方書新增煉藥鍋、鍛造台配方以及多種便利性改動！</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/D7kcXWaZra\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://discord.gg/D7kcXWaZra</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fbrb\" rel=\"nofollow\">請至 Modrinth 搜尋本模組，以獲得最佳體驗！</a></p>\n<h2>功能特色</h2>\n<h3><strong>煉藥鍋配方書</strong></h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/mrshmllow/BetterRecipeBook/assets/40532058/73c81196-9563-4482-8d4e-b0b980ee8f12\" alt=\"one\"></p>\n<h3><strong>鍛造台配方書</strong></h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/mrshmllow/BetterRecipeBook/assets/40532058/30f27b5b-7e4d-4c81-8229-33c0d8391783\" alt=\"two\"></p>\n<h3><strong>釘選常用配方</strong></h3>\n<p>透過快捷鍵將配方釘選至最上方</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/mrshmllow/BetterRecipeBook/assets/40532058/aadc51e7-68fa-42a2-9672-6deadd77b91e\" alt=\"three\"></p>\n<h3><strong>即時合成開關</strong></h3>\n<p>啟用後可單擊即進行合成。按住 Shift 鍵則會盡量合成所能做出的數量。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/mrshmllow/BetterRecipeBook/assets/40532058/cb8f0305-fea7-4547-8e91-ff0c17e25ada\" alt=\"four\"></p>\n<h3><strong>查看未解鎖配方</strong></h3>\n<p>可選擇查看尚未解鎖的配方。純客戶端功能！</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/mrshmllow/BetterRecipeBook/assets/40532058/6a4ebc98-a5ee-4271-97d0-b2af6f13a60a\" alt=\"image\"></p>\n<h3><strong>取消配方分組</strong></h3>\n<p>如果您喜歡釘選特定配方的話，這個功能非常實用！</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/mrshmllow/BetterRecipeBook/assets/40532058/e8abc1f1-6b37-4447-895c-0c86a02d38d8\" alt=\"five_compare\"></p>\n<h3><strong>還有更多...</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>使用滑鼠滾輪翻頁</li>\n<li>開啟配方書時，將合成介面保持在畫面中央</li>\n<li>顯示熔爐配方，讓您能<em>真正</em>看到它們：</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>現在</strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mrshmllow/BetterRecipeBook/main/.github/images/furnace/now.png\" alt=\"now\"></p>\n<p><strong>之前</strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mrshmllow/BetterRecipeBook/main/.github/images/furnace/then.png\" alt=\"then\"></p>\n<ul>\n<li>啟用或停用解鎖動畫</li>\n</ul>\n<p>另外……如果您願意，也可以完全停用配方書。</p>",
